{"name":"Millennium Orientalism","title":"Millennium Orientalism","revision":236509,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Millennium_Orientalism","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Millennium Orientalism (also known as Eastern Exoticism) is an aesthetic that draws upon the Far East (China and Japan), Southeast Asia, and the Middle East (including Indian, Moroccan, and Moorish influences). This style originated in the 1990s and reached its peak in the 2000s, then faded out after 2010. Some of this style, primarily the Indian & Middle Eastern influenced portion, was referred to as 'Bohemian' at the time."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The styles uses elements from other cultures to create a foreign and exotic feeling. Script fonts tend to mimic Arabic, Chinese and Japanese letters."},{"kind":"list","text":"Dragons"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mosaic Patterns"},{"kind":"list","text":"Moroccan-style geometric tiles"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"list","text":"long skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"sleeveless tops"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Shows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Arabian Nights (2000)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Movies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Aladdin (1992)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bratz: Genie Magic (2006)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Cheetah Girls: One World (2008)"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/1/1f/Genie_Magic_2.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260625082644","caption":"Genie Magic 2","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Genie_Magic_2.webp","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0645-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/b/bb/Bratz_Genie_Magic.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260625082435","caption":"Millennium Orientalism · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bratz_Genie_Magic.webp","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0645-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}